+# Generate a calendar year's four quarterly periods, named yyyy-Q1 to yyyy-Q4, each from its first month's first day
+# to its last month's last day, made as the period form adds them: a quarter whose name is already a period on the
+# sheet, or whose days overlap one, is left out and the others are still made, each audited as PERIOD_ADDED.
+# A year that is not four digits is refused (400). Answers how many were made.
